# Copy to .env.local and set to YOUR real Obsidian vault path.
# Nexus OS auto-saves chats, goals, and journal entries into an
# "Agentic OS" folder here, as one markdown file per day.
#
# You can also set this from the app's Journal tab (no file editing needed).
#
# macOS example (replace <you> with your username):
OBSIDIAN_VAULT_PATH=/Users/<you>/Documents/ObsidianVault
#
# Windows example — use forward slashes OR an unquoted path with backslashes:
# OBSIDIAN_VAULT_PATH=C:/Users/You/Documents/Obsidian Vault

# Optional: override which Claude CLI binary the bridge spawns.
# CLAUDE_BIN=claude
# CLAUDE_PERMISSION_MODE=dontAsk
